# FS25_FieldToDoList - Project Rules

## Release and Build

- Keep `modDesc.xml` version unchanged unless the user explicitly requests a release bump.
- Build: `python3 tools/generate_assets.py && ./build.sh`. After mod updates: **full FS25 restart** (dedicated: restart **server and clients**).
- GitHub release: tag `vX.Y.Z.W` must match `<version>` in `modDesc.xml`; workflow `.github/workflows/release.yml` builds/uploads `FS25_FieldToDoList.zip` (`docs/RELEASE.md`).

## Maintainer shell (fish)

- Maintainer uses **fish** — no bash-only heredocs/`source <(…)` in copy-paste without noting fish adaptation (`CONTRIBUTING.md`).
- Git commits: single `-m "…"` or fish-safe multi-line string.

## Lua / Runtime Safety

- **No `goto` / labels** — Lua 5.1 runtime; file may fail to load.
- **No runtime `fields.xml` reads** (`FieldSavegameReader.ENABLE_DISK_READ = false`).
- No repeated file reads or SCS `buildFieldMap` loops in menu paths; defer startup reads (`deferReadsUntilGameplay`).
- `FSDensityMapUtil` global often **nil** — fruit/weed via `FieldState`; do not depend on it in menu paths.

## DensityMapHeightUtil (windrow / straw liters)

- **Vanilla windrow source:** `DensityMapHeightUtil.getFillLevelAtArea(fillType, x0,z0, x1,z1, x2,z2)` — **6 coords** (parallelogram), not 4.
- **Mod access:** resolve via `type(DensityMapHeightUtil) == "table"` first — `rawget(_G, "DensityMapHeightUtil")` is often **nil** though the class exists at runtime.
- Cache util only when found; **`invalidateDensityMapHeightUtil()` on save load** (`ToDoManager.onStartMission`).
- **Not usable for production windrows:** `getDensityTypeIndexAtWorldPos`, `getDensityHeightAtWorldPos` (nil/noise in mod runtime). API experiments: **`ftdlStrawScan <fieldId>`** only.

## Straw logistics (Stroh)

- **One deciding function:** `deriveStrawResidueSummary` — STRAW liters only (`callFillLevelAtArea`, center + E–W/N–S cross). `hasWindrow = crossFillMax >= fillMinLiters`. No type/height/stubble/phase fallback.
- **Context / UI:** `fieldHasStrawLogisticsContext` — strohgebende Frucht (`STRAW_PRODUCING_FRUITS`) **and** (`hasWindrow` **or** straw bales on field). Stubble alone or spreader-off field → no press suggestion.
- **Actions:** `addStrawLogisticsActions` — windrows → `straw_bale`; bales only → `straw_bale_collect`. Listed **before** mulch in `post_harvest`.
- **Bales:** `classifyBaleKind` / field polygon; **Hof** excluded (`isBalePositionOnFarmyardPlot`) — yard bales ≠ field straw.
- Details: `docs/DECISIONS.md` (Stroh-Schwaden entry).

## Grass residue (meadow)

- **One source:** `deriveGrassResidueSummary` — windrow liters (`resolveGrassWindrowFillIndex` + `callFillLevelAtArea`, same path as straw). `SWATH` / `BALED` / `NONE`; loose not distinguished.
- **cut:** `SWATH` → collect/bale/silage; no liters → full chain from swath; bales → collect only.

## Field overview scan (performance)

- **Two paths — do not merge:** (1) overview incremental scan on menu open, (2) task auto-complete ~1 s for fields with open trackable tasks only.
- On auto-complete done: `refreshFieldRecordSync(fieldId)` — not full rescan wait.
- Grid: overview **3** steps, completion **5**. Pacing: batch 5 / 40 ms; up to 2 batches/frame while tab open. `reloadData()` on batch progress (not `reloadVisibleItems()`).
- `deferredListReload` → `refreshLists(false)` — never invalidate owned-fields cache on 500 ms poll.
- Hooks: `FINISHED_GROWTH_PERIOD` + `g_farmlandManager:addStateChangeListener` → `markOwnedFieldsOverviewStale()` (FS25 has no `FARMLAND_OWNER_CHANGED` message).
- First paint: all rows + `...` placeholders; yellow ● while scanning, green when done.

## UI / To-Do / HUD

- Order by `sortIndex`; guard list selection by task id (`ignoreTaskSelectionChanged`).
- Open above completed; completed cap 10; `moveTask` stays within open/completed group.
- HUD: manual tasks only, max 5. Logging via `FieldToDoLog` / `Logging`, not `print()`.
- **HUD drag / click:** title-bar drag + row click-to-complete need unlocked mouse cursor; position in client `modSettings/FS25_FieldToDoList/hud.xml` (not savegame sidecar).
- **HUD update gate:** run `FieldToDoHudOverlay:update(dt)` **before** `areGameFieldsReady()` early-return in `ToDoManager:update` — draw is not fields-gated; mouse/drag must not wait on field map.

## Multiplayer / edit grants

- Server-authoritative sync (`FieldToDoSync` + request/notify/state events). Schema version bumps must stay client/server matched (**current: v5**).
- **World read vs mutate:** overview/crop/grass = **client-local** `FieldState`; task/settings mutations = **server** + sidecar. Dedicated does not run overview scan.
- **FarmId on wire:** every mutation notify/request payload (except DENY) carries trailing `farmId` Int32 — required so pure clients can apply settings and multi-farm guards work.
- **Edit gate:** SP always; MP = vanilla **`manageContracts`** only via `getHasPlayerPermission` (MissionStartEvent path; no ESC grants, no `ftdlEditTodos`, no `defaultAllow`, no Farm-API cascade). Soft-disable edit buttons forbidden (deny dialog on click). Auto-complete: same-farm via `getFarmByUserId` only. API history: `docs/FALLBACK_AUDIT.md`.
- **FarmId:** `FieldToDoPermissions.resolveLocalFarmId()` for scan + local edit UI. Notify upserts must resolve farmId (nil farmId tasks are hidden once a local farm is known).
- **Sync UX:** DENY → InfoDialog + reason; successful notify → refresh ESC list (`refreshAfterNotify`). Debug: `ftdlSync`, `ftdlOwned`.
- **Owned non-crop parcels:** field-less owned farmlands (Hof/Windrad/…) appear as Hof-style overview rows.
- **Farm user lists:** `getUsers` / `getActiveUsers` may return **User objects** — always use `FieldToDoPermissions.extractUserIdFromFarmUserEntry`.
- **Membership:** remote ops resolve farm via `resolveFarmIdForUser` / `userBelongsToFarm`; unknown membership → deny (no host `getLocalFarmId()` fallback).
- **Sidecar write:** only server (`canPersistSidecar`); clients never write `fieldToDoList.xml`.
- **XML schema:** every attribute written by `setValue` must be `schema:register`’d.
## Windows buddy updater

- Single-file helper: `tools/Update-FS25_FieldToDoList.bat` (no `.ps1`). Compares local mods zip to GitHub latest release; replaces when newer. Ship/document as optional install path.

## Advisor (classification, harvest, weed)

- Multi-probe aggregation (`aggregateFieldProbes`); **Ernte month** from **center** (`aggregation.harvestState`), not max-growth edges.
- Dual-window maize: `isFruitPrimaryHarvestInPeriod` + grain-ready (`minHarvestingGrowthState`), not first silage window alone.
- Bare worked soil (`PLOWED`/`CULTIVATED`/`SEEDBED`, growth 0): crop display `-`, no grass fallback.
- Plow done: `PLOWED` + `needsPlowing == false` (ignore stale `plowLevel` alone).
- Grass cut: no re-mow; specific grass names (Luzerne etc.) only with density/residue/field hint — never via equal growth-score tie / `+20` bonus.
- **Generic meadow index:** `getDefaultGrassFruitTypeIndex` prefers `GRASS`/`MEADOW`/… (not first `isGrassCrop`).
- **grass_mow complete:** `getGrassMowCutRatio` ≥ 0.98; post-mow must not be blocked by wrong specific-grass `harvestReady` (generic GRASS `isCut` wins).
- **HUD position:** `hud.xml` requires registered XMLSchema (`FieldToDoHudOverlay.initXMLSchema`).
- Weed: `WeedAdvice.deriveWeedAdvice`; coverage wins when `weedSummary.total > 0`; dead min state 6; spray only at state ≥3 or live ≥10%.
- **Fertilize:** `FertilizerAdvice.deriveFertilizerAdvice` — PF nitrogen when ready, else `sprayLevel` vs `resolveSprayLevelMax()` (fallback 2; 1× mods lower max).
- Bale counts field-local only.

## Consolidation

- One decision = one function (`docs/CONSOLIDATION_AND_NAMING_PLAN.md`). No parallel `is*`/`has*` beside existing decision logic.
- Regression: `docs/REGRESSION.md` (5-field + straw chain when touching advisor).

## Debug (manual only)

- **F9** / LCtrl+F9: as in 0.1.0.15 (Player/Vehicle + native-then-dialog). Not permission-gated.
- Log: `[FS25_FieldToDoList] DUMP` / `STRAW_SCAN`. No auto-dump on menu open or load.
- Straw UI check: `strawResidue: hasWindrow fillApiReady centerFill crossFillMax` in dump; API matrix in `STRAW_SCAN`.

## Validation snapshots

- Plowed empty ≠ grass (Field 14 class); lucerne cut ≠ re-mow; harvest-ready cereals flagged; dead weed ≤5% live → no combat.
- Standing meadow GRASS must not display as Luzerne without residue/density/field hint.
- Half-mowed grass_mow stays open until ≥98% post-mow sample coverage.
- Körnermais Apr growth 1 → Ernte **Okt**, not Jul.
- **Stroh:** visible swaths → `hasWindrow=true` → „Stroh pressen“ before mulch; yard bales not counted on field.
- **Dedicated MP:** with `defaultAllow` on, Planfrucht / add / adopt must work without per-user grants; `fieldToDoList.xml` save must not log unregistered `#todoEditDefaultAllow`.
